{"3764180": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Lone City", "steam_appid": 3764180, "required_age": 0, "is_free": true, "dlc": [3764210, 3764190], "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >At the world's end, the lone city breathes in silence.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this desolate metropolis, you have only three things: a loyal dog, a sleek sports car, and your solitary will.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>World</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A vast, perilous post-apocalyptic city awaits your exploration.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Survival</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gather resources, cultivate crops, craft food and weapons to endure the wasteland.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Shooting</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience AAA-level first/third-person shooting with intense combat.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Car</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Drive and customize various sports cars with realistic physics and stunning skins.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Monsters</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face dozens of unique mutated creatures, each with distinct abilities.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Building</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Construct and personalize your own shelter amidst the ruins.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Story</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Moral choices between good and evil lie hidden in the wasteland.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Harem</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take more than twenty beautiful girls with different personalities home, develop mutual feelings with them and make marriage commitments.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Follow our Kickstarter page here:lone city</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Note: The above is the content of the complete version of the game. Currently, there is not that much content in the game.</strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>This game is still growing. I'm starting from scratch and working hard to refine every detail.</strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>It's free. If you wish, please add it to your wish list and be part of every moment of its birth.</strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>You can also take a look at another of our games, &quot;Rider Valkyries&quot;.</strong></h2>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >At the world's end, the lone city breathes in silence.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this desolate metropolis, you have only three things: a loyal dog, a sleek sports car, and your solitary will.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>World</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A vast, perilous post-apocalyptic city awaits your exploration.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Survival</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gather resources, cultivate crops, craft food and weapons to endure the wasteland.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Shooting</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience AAA-level first/third-person shooting with intense combat.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Car</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Drive and customize various sports cars with realistic physics and stunning skins.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Monsters</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face dozens of unique mutated creatures, each with distinct abilities.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Building</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Construct and personalize your own shelter amidst the ruins.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Story</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Moral choices between good and evil lie hidden in the wasteland.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Harem</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take more than twenty beautiful girls with different personalities home, develop mutual feelings with them and make marriage commitments.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Follow our Kickstarter page here:lone city</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Note: The above is the content of the complete version of the game. Currently, there is not that much content in the game.</strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>This game is still growing. I'm starting from scratch and working hard to refine every detail.</strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>It's free. If you wish, please add it to your wish list and be part of every moment of its birth.</strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>You can also take a look at another of our games, &quot;Rider Valkyries&quot;.</strong></h2>", "short_description": "Lone City is a first/third-person open-world survival shooter. The world is gone—only you, a dog, and a sleek car remain. No missions, no hope. Just ruins, silence, and a flicker of life refusing to die.", "supported_languages": "English, German, Russian, Japanese, Simplified Chinese, Korean, French, Spanish - Spain, Ukrainian, Turkish, Polish, Traditional Chinese, Portuguese - Brazil, Portuguese - Portugal, Czech, Thai", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3764180/876dc040d4ca6179313494e62633991819523a24/header.jpg?t=1787746542", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3764180/4bf0c839f5dcff6bc553664cfcd3746c3a5754af/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1787746542", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3764180/4bf0c839f5dcff6bc553664cfcd3746c3a5754af/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1787746542", "website": "https://www.kickstarter.com/projects/yangyuanjie/lone-city", "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows8<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> i5-7300HQ<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 16 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> RTX2050<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 12<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 5 GB available space</li></ul>"}, "mac_requ